@startuml UseCase_B_CreateLink
title Use Case B: 創建連線 (Creating a Link)
note top: 規格: 從一個物件的Port連線到另一個物件的Port

actor User
participant __aUMLEditor__ as UMLEditor
participant __aCanvas__ as Canvas
participant __aCreateLinkMode__ as CreateLinkMode
participant __aBasicObject1__ as BasicObject1
participant __aPort1__ as Port1
participant __aPort2__   as Port2
participant __aBasicObject2__ as BasicObject2
participant __aConnectionLine__ as ConnectionLine

note over User: Precondition: Association/Generalization/Composition按鈕被按下

== Step 1: 在Port上按下滑鼠 ==

User -> Canvas ++ : 1. 在某個Rect/Oval物件的Port範圍內按下左鍵(不放開)
Canvas -> CreateLinkMode ++ : mousePressed(MouseEvent)
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : 遍歷所有圖形
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -> BasicObject1 ++ : getPortAt(Point)
BasicObject1 -> Port1 ++ : contains(Point)
Port1 -->> BasicObject1 -- : return true
BasicObject1 -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return Port1
CreateLinkMode -> CreateLinkMode ++ : startPort = Port1\nsourceShape = BasicObject1
CreateLinkMode -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -->> Canvas -- : return

alt Alternative B.1: mousePressed座標不在任何物件Port範圍內
CreateLinkMode -> CreateLinkMode ++ : startPort = null\nsourceShape = null
CreateLinkMode -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
end

== Step 2: 拖曳滑鼠(需要有有效的startPort) ==

User -> Canvas : 2. 不放開左鍵，進行拖曳(drag)

Canvas -> CreateLinkMode ++ : mouseDragged(MouseEvent)

alt startPort有效(不為null)
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : 清除所有圖形的hovered狀態
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : getTopShapeAt(currentPoint)
Canvas -> BasicObject2 ++ : contains(Point)
BasicObject2 -->> Canvas -- : return true
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return BasicObject2
CreateLinkMode -> BasicObject2 ++ : setHovered(true)
BasicObject2 -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : repaint()
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas : 顯示從startPort到當前座標的預覽線

else startPort為null(在空白區域按下)
CreateLinkMode -->> Canvas -- : return (直接結束，不進行任何操作)
end
CreateLinkMode -->> Canvas -- : return

== Step 3: 放開滑鼠(需要有有效的startPort和終點Port) ==

User -> Canvas : 3. 拖曳到另一個Rect/Oval物件的Port放開左鍵

Canvas -> CreateLinkMode ++ : mouseReleased(MouseEvent)

alt startPort有效(不為null)
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : 遍歷所有圖形尋找endPort
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -> BasicObject2 ++ : getPortAt(releasePoint)
BasicObject2 -> Port2 ++ : contains(Point)
Port2 -->> BasicObject2 -- : return true
BasicObject2 -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return Port2
CreateLinkMode -> CreateLinkMode ++ : endPort = Port2\n檢查: startPort.parent != endPort.parent
CreateLinkMode -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return

alt 終點有效 && 不能自己連自己(檢查通過)
CreateLinkMode -> ConnectionLine ++ : new ConnectionLine(Port1, Port2, LinkType.ASSOCIATION)
ConnectionLine -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return ConnectionLine
note right of CreateLinkMode: 連線直接 new,不經工廠(連線非工廠方法的對象)
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : addShape(connectionLine)
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : repaint()
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
CreateLinkMode -> Canvas ++ : returnToDefaultMode()
Canvas -> Canvas : setCurrentMode(defaultMode = SelectMode)
Canvas -> UMLEditor : onModeChanged(SelectMode) [事件→highlightActiveButton 更新按鈕]
Canvas -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return

else 終點無效或自己連自己(檢查失敗)
CreateLinkMode -> CreateLinkMode ++ : 不建立任何連線物件
CreateLinkMode -->> CreateLinkMode -- : return
end

else startPort為null(在空白區域按下)
CreateLinkMode -->> Canvas -- : return (操作被中止，不進行任何處理)
end
CreateLinkMode -->> Canvas -- : return

@enduml